  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transfer of Environmentally Sound Technologies (TEST) for the treatment of biological sludge from Mojkovac#s municipal waste water treatment plant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The immediate objective of the project is to facilitate the Transfer of Environmentally Sound Technology (TEST), to establish a pilot sludge drying unit in Mojkovac town using constructed reed bed filters and to strengthen institutional capacities for the sustainable use of this environmentally sound technology.</narrative>
  </description>
